{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Fund clinical research into wellness and longevity peptides",
        "additional_details": "While funding seems to be focused on treating late-stage diseases, we think that proactive biological optimization is largely ignored. Formal government grants could allow independent institutions to map out long-term biological outcomes, establish standardized dosing parameters, and protect citizens through evidence-based guidelines rather than internet speculation.",
        "background": "We urge the UK Government to fund clinical research into wellness and longevity peptides. Increased funding could support proactive preventative health, improve public safety by curbing unregulated markets, and help reduce the long-term burden on the NHS.",
